        "SRC001373",
        "SRC001376",
        "SRC001563",
        "SRC001569",
        "SRC001593",
        "SRC001565",
        "SRC001574",
        "SRC001596"
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "SEC015",
      "title": "Recognizing Who Stands Before You",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "When Melchizedek met Abraham, there was no prior prophecy about him. Scripture gives no prophetic announcement preparing Abraham for that encounter.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA048",
            "SRC001393",
            "SRC001394",
            "SRC001402",
            "SRC001387"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC001393",
            "SRC001394",
            "SRC001402",
            "SRC001387",
            "SRC001407"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA048"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000009",
          "provider_handle": "p9"
        },
        {
          "text": "Yet when Abraham met him, Abraham recognized that he was different, and Abraham submitted to him. Nothing external told Abraham who this man was. It was the witness of the Spirit of God that revealed Melchizedek's higher spiritual authority, not according to age or outward stature, so that Abraham would recognize what he was dealing with.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA049",
            "EX006",
            "SRC001407",
            "SRC001408",
            "SRC001413",
            "SRC001418",
            "SRC001426"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC001407",
            "SRC001408",
            "SRC001413",
            "SRC001418",
            "SRC001426",
            "SRC001387",
            "SRC001394"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA049"
          ],
          "example_refs": [
            "EX006"
          ],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000010",
          "provider_handle": "p10"
        },
        {
          "text": "This is why vigilance matters. We must always remain alert to recognize a higher spiritual presence when God places it before us, because wherever God has led us, a wrong attitude can cause us to miss what he has set in our path.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA050",
            "SRC001432",
            "SRC001435",
            "SRC001439"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC001432",
            "SRC001435",
            "SRC001439"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA050"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000011",
          "provider_handle": "p11"
        }
      ],
      "idea_refs": [
        "IDEA048",
        "IDEA049",
        "IDEA050"
      ],
      "source_refs": [
        "SRC001393",
        "SRC001394",
        "SRC001402",
        "SRC001387",
        "SRC001407",
        "SRC001408",
