        "SRC001432",
        "SRC001435",
        "SRC001439"
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "SEC016",
      "title": "Malachi's Warning to the Priests",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Malachi, in chapter 2, records a warning to the priests. If they will not hear, if they do not take it to heart to give glory to God's name, he says he will send a curse upon them, and he will curse their blessing.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA051",
            "SRC001441",
            "SRC001452",
            "SRC001458",
            "SRC001461"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC001441",
            "SRC001452",
            "SRC001458",
            "SRC001461"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA051"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000012",
          "provider_handle": "p12"
        },
        {
          "text": "God's covenant with Levi was a covenant of life and peace. He gave that covenant so that Levi would fear him, and Levi did fear him and stood in awe of his name.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA052",
            "SRC001477",
            "SRC001483",
            "SRC001495",
            "SRC001499"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC001477",
            "SRC001483",
            "SRC001495",
            "SRC001499",
            "SRC001504",
            "SRC001524",
            "SRC001536"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA052"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [
            "UNC006"
          ],
          "paragraph_id": "P000013",
          "provider_handle": "p13"
        },
        {
          "text": "The lips of the priest must guard knowledge, and people should seek instruction from his mouth, for he is the messenger of the Lord of hosts. The exact placement of this statement within verse 5 and verse 7 of the chapter was read more than once and is not entirely certain in its verse order, but the teaching itself is clear: the priest's lips carry the law because he speaks as a messenger sent from God.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA053",
            "SRC001504",
            "SRC001524",
            "SRC001527",
            "SRC001532",
            "SRC001536",
            "SRC001542"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC001504",
            "SRC001524",
            "SRC001527",
            "SRC001532",
            "SRC001536",
            "SRC001542"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA053"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [
            "UNC006"
          ],
          "paragraph_id": "P000014",
          "provider_handle": "p14"
        },
        {
          "text": "Those who walk closely with God, so close that what they carry becomes recognized by others, end up establishing something more than personal conviction. What they establish is received by others as principles, and those principles become, in time, authoritative laws for how people live.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA054",
            "SRC001545",
            "SRC001552",
            "SRC001561"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC001545",
            "SRC001552",
            "SRC001561"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA054"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000015",
          "provider_handle": "p15"
        }
      ],
      "idea_refs": [
        "IDEA051",
        "IDEA052",
        "IDEA053",
        "IDEA054"
      ],
      "source_refs": [
        "SRC001441",
        "SRC001452",
        "SRC001458",
        "SRC001461",
        "SRC001477",
        "SRC001483",
        "SRC001495",
        "SRC001499",
        "SRC001504",
        "SRC001524",
        "SRC001536",
        "SRC001527",
        "SRC001532",
        "SRC001542",
        "SRC001545",
        "SRC001552",
        "SRC001561"
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "SEC017",
      "title": "Let No One Despise the Calling",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "It is not humility for a minister to pretend he is just like everyone else when he has been called of God. We are not the same. Denying a genuine calling in the name of modesty is a false humility, not a true one.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA056",
            "SRC001613",
            "SRC001618",
            "SRC001620"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC001613",
            "SRC001618",
            "SRC001620"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA056"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000016",
          "provider_handle": "p16"
        },
        {
          "text": "The work of ministry is heavy. It demands full commitment, without arrogance, and also without false modesty that holds back from the weight of the calling. Commit yourself to it, neither boasting over it nor shrinking from it.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA057",
            "SRC001623",
            "SRC001625",
            "SRC001630"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC001623",
            "SRC001625",
            "SRC001630"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA057"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000017",
          "provider_handle": "p17"
        },
        {
          "text": "Paul's charge to Timothy, found in 2 Timothy chapter 1, not to let anyone despise his youth, is not an instruction to confront people or to assert himself in anyone's face. It concerns something inward: a settled confidence in the calling he carried, not an outward posture of defiance.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA058",
            "SRC001638",
            "SRC001640",
            "SRC001642",
            "SRC001031"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC001638",
            "SRC001640",
            "SRC001642",
            "SRC001031"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA058"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000018",
          "provider_handle": "p18"
        },
        {
          "text": "When someone truly finds God, others come looking for that person; there is no need to strain after recognition or chase an audience. I have never had to look for people in that sense; rather, people had to look for me, the day they found what was genuine.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA059",
            "SRC001650",
            "SRC001658",
            "SRC001666"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC001650",
            "SRC001658",
            "SRC001666"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA059"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000019",
          "provider_handle": "p19"
        },
        {
          "text": "It is like a woman looking for a good hairdresser: if she has to cross seven mountains and seven valleys to find one who is genuinely gifted, she will cross them and enter the lobby, because what is authentic draws people to seek it out.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "EX007",
            "SRC001675",
            "SRC001687",
            "SRC001699"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC001675",
            "SRC001687",
            "SRC001699"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [],
          "example_refs": [
            "EX007"
          ],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000020",
          "provider_handle": "p20"
        }
      ],
